{"id": "PL44ABC9278E2EE706", "title": "MIT 9.00SC Introduction to Psychology, Fall 2011", "availability": "public", "channel_follower_count": null, "description": "View the complete course: http://ocw.mit.edu/9-00SCS11\n\nInstructor: John Gabrieli\n\nIntroduction to Psychology is a survey of the scientific study of human nature, including how the mind works, and how the brain supports the mind. Topics include the mental and neural bases of perception, emotion, learning, memory, cognition, child development, personality, psychopathology, and social interaction.\n\nLicense: Creative Commons BY-NC-SA\nMore information at http://ocw.mit.edu/terms\nMore courses at http://ocw.mit.edu", "tags": [], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2fbrl6WoIyo/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEwCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDIwgBFQAAiEIYAfABAfgB_gSAAugCigIMCAAQARhVIF0oZTAP&rs=AOn4CLBhvFztJ85ZoTu8EB9zidBkglzVDA", "height": 94, "width": 168, "id": "0", "resolution": "168x94"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2fbrl6WoIyo/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEwCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDIwgBFQAAiEIYAfABAfgB_gSAAugCigIMCAAQARhVIF0oZTAP&rs=AOn4CLDUwAqYN6YZg5Lrz6H5QAcUpxnIMw", "height": 110, "width": 196, "id": "1", "resolution": "196x110"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2fbrl6WoIyo/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwExCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAyMIARUAAIhCGAHwAQH4Af4EgALoAooCDAgAEAEYVSBdKGUwDw==&rs=AOn4CLA1TCy4LDlD154ghesC_JLVAgC3Hw", "height": 138, "width": 246, "id": "2", "resolution": "246x138"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2fbrl6WoIyo/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwExCNACELwBSFryq4qpAyMIARUAAIhCGAHwAQH4Af4EgALoAooCDAgAEAEYVSBdKGUwDw==&rs=AOn4CLCONxEh-R-jTKU12fxn3kWhcVABTw", "height": 188, "width": 336, "id": "3", "resolution": "336x188"}], "modified_date": "20140702", "view_count": 1504175, "playlist_count": 24, "channel": "MIT OpenCourseWare", "channel_id": "UCEBb1b_L6zDS3xTUrIALZOw", "uploader_id": "@mitocw", "uploader": "MIT OpenCourseWare", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEBb1b_L6zDS3xTUrIALZOw", "uploader_url": "https://www.